{"steam_appid":2929250,"steam_name":"over the hill","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2929250/558386778/0bb3ef58749e25ba6de3205d99c11660f84e87da/1790952533/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791993398","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257444012/dcf0b6ca3e5991596d8bbc52990a0a82ceecb19c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791993398","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/d115bf36d8c9e850dac67f55735e897641155fd9/ss_d115bf36d8c9e850dac67f55735e897641155fd9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792002879","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/1be192d15a0a8355bbdf93c015044b53c68e3503/ss_1be192d15a0a8355bbdf93c015044b53c68e3503.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792002879","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/5b34ad76f95d41faeb71478884cf1cc6f008e1c5/ss_5b34ad76f95d41faeb71478884cf1cc6f008e1c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792002879","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/4012446264b216a6266d30b7f50c811c76afaf78/ss_4012446264b216a6266d30b7f50c811c76afaf78.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792002879","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/e52051b0238166993451eee8613c7f43cfa52bfe/ss_e52051b0238166993451eee8613c7f43cfa52bfe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792002879"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, navigate, and uncover the vast wilderness of over the hill, the newest installation from the creator of art of rally. Ramble your way through varied biomes inspired by real-world locations, from valleys to mountains and everything in between.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/6fdc03ec0943c6ab6d55d8a940ab7263.webp?t=1792002879\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the trails solo or with up to three friends. Cruise through scenic landscapes, tackle challenging off-road routes, and work together to overcome the obstacles standing between you and your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different situations call for different solutions. Use planks to cross gaps, deploy winches to recover vehicles and navigate difficult terrain, and bring the right equipment to help you overcome the challenges ahead. Whether you're carefully planning your route or improvising your way through a tricky situation, the journey is always in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/de72ed5418647f75e7795d054771ff3e.poster.avif?t=1792002879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/de72ed5418647f75e7795d054771ff3e.webm?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/de72ed5418647f75e7795d054771ff3e.mp4?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/1f45c2f2cd544f5850473f2278b757ab.webp?t=1792002879\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, lakesides, and mountains as you uncover remote cabins, scenic viewpoints, natural landmarks, meteorites that have fallen from the sky, and portals that can take you to new areas. Dynamic weather and day/night cycles can transform the world around you and change the conditions of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/a30a989c260473ae322953825f83b178.poster.avif?t=1792002879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/a30a989c260473ae322953825f83b178.webm?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/a30a989c260473ae322953825f83b178.mp4?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/ea228aaa21bce262f1175181c73972e2.webp?t=1792002879\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot native wildlife and use the in-game camera to document your discoveries. Photograph the animals you encounter to fill out your wildlife compendium, or stop to capture an awe-inspiring landscape, a beautiful sunset, or any other moment worth remembering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/da1f38b6bc6fa80d020644e5a61dd5a4.poster.avif?t=1792002879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/da1f38b6bc6fa80d020644e5a61dd5a4.webm?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/da1f38b6bc6fa80d020644e5a61dd5a4.mp4?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/9e3772141a46b7054725e783dace3690.webp?t=1792002879\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find upgrades and equipment throughout the world to help you take on the terrain ahead. Stop at merchants and cabins to customize your vehicle with colours, accessories, and cosmetics that suit your driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/cdb0cdace442fbf0edc0b8855b70c17d.poster.avif?t=1792002879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/cdb0cdace442fbf0edc0b8855b70c17d.webm?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/cdb0cdace442fbf0edc0b8855b70c17d.mp4?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/faf4fc300a5f735528373570bf1884e3.webp?t=1792002879\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a driving game, not a racing game. Take your time, enjoy the drive, find your own route, and see where the road leads. The best stories never start at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/0e217266336669a0ab9728fa290f49da.poster.avif?t=1792002879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/0e217266336669a0ab9728fa290f49da.webm?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929250/extras/0e217266336669a0ab9728fa290f49da.mp4?t=1792002879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX 5600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Specs tested on FullHD resolution</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Racing","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":["Funselektor Labs Inc."],"publishers":["Funselektor Labs Inc."],"release_date":"Oct 14, 2026"}